{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10600001","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10600001","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1060000101:1":{"text":"방울을 흔들면 동물을 유인하는 소리를 낼 수 있어요. 그 틈을 이용해 가까이 다가가면 동물들이 따라올 거예요.","source_cn":"摇动铃铛可以发出吸引动物的声音，只要趁这个时候靠近它们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86711A217BBE8233","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1060000102:1":{"text":"하지만 주변에 그들의 관심을 끄는 다른 무언가가 있을 수 있어요.","source_cn":"不过，附近可能会有其他东西吸引它们的注意力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8E874F1CE6D1534","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1060000103:1":{"text":"그러니 방울을 흔들고 최대한 빨리 동물들을 데려와야 합니다.","source_cn":"所以，摇动铃铛之后，一定要尽快带它们回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FE9BAD080D8DB3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民瑞卡":{"text":"리카","source":"村民瑞卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}